    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884520/extras/20cfd1a5e3311dddb475ea7583a5518b.poster.avif?t=1729344785\" width=450 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884520/extras/20cfd1a5e3311dddb475ea7583a5518b.webm?t=1729344785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884520/extras/20cfd1a5e3311dddb475ea7583a5518b.mp4?t=1729344785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A NEW ADVENTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The Outbound Ghost: Reborn</i> </strong> is a new entry in the universe of <strong><i>The Outbound Ghost</i></strong> that follows an alternate timeline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>Figments</strong> of your imagination to do combat against other spirit wielders in an improved combat system where strategizing is everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884520/extras/ccaf9b06c96b02e3a5b096aae5df1ae3.poster.avif?t=1729344785\" width=450 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884520/extras/ccaf9b06c96b02e3a5b096aae5df1ae3.webm?t=1729344785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884520/extras/ccaf9b06c96b02e3a5b096aae5df1ae3.mp4?t=1729344785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A NEW STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a whole new story focused entirely on <strong>The Ghost</strong> that takes you through new areas of Outbound never seen before, and pits you against <strong>The Bound One</strong>, as seen in <strong>Soul Stalker</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the first time in the series, build a relationship with your Figments, and work together to bring down the being that is responsible for purgatory itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884520/extras/b612f93ad46a97a874a545de638bc372.poster.avif?t=1729344785\" width=450 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884520/extras/b612f93ad46a97a874a545de638bc372.webm?t=1729344785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2884520/extras/b612f93ad46a97a874a545de638bc372.mp4?t=1729344785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OVERHAULED COMBAT |</strong> <strong><i>Reborn</i></strong>'s combat features many improvements over the original game's including replenishing SP, type matchups, and a reworked equipment system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE GHOST'S ADVENTURE |</strong> Experience a new story that has you play as one protagonist throughout the whole game. Learn about yourself through talking to your inner demons - your <strong>Figments</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OUTBOUND LOCATIONS |</strong> Use the new train stations to travel between areas, many of which are entirely new to the series.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A PAPERY WORLD |</strong> Experience the remastered visual style that makes use of cel shading, in combination with the classic paper-flat characters.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENTIRELY FREE*</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*<strong><i>The Outbound Ghost: Reborn</i></strong> will be entirely free to you if you own the original <i><strong>The Outbound Ghost</strong></i> game on Steam before the new game comes out in 2025. Purchase <strong><i>The Outbound Ghost </i></strong>now\u00a0and get two full adventures for the price of one!</p>",
